# Essay workspaces and private material must never be committed.
# Anchored so the plugin folder plugins/betterpaper/ is not hidden.
/betterpaper/
**/drafts/
**/reviews/
**/reviewer-notes/
**/anchors/
**/sources/
**/worksheets/
**/_private/
**/feedback/

# The fictional demo workspace shipped inside the plugin is the only exception.
!/plugins/betterpaper/demo/**/drafts/
!/plugins/betterpaper/demo/**/reviews/
!/plugins/betterpaper/demo/**/reviewer-notes/
!/plugins/betterpaper/demo/**/anchors/
!/plugins/betterpaper/demo/**/sources/
!/plugins/betterpaper/demo/**/worksheets/
!/plugins/betterpaper/demo/**/feedback/

.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
